        }
      ],
      "message": "txospenderindex: key entries by block sequence instead of disk position\n\nUse the txindex key scheme: a 5-byte salted hash of the spent outpoint,\nfollowed by the block sequence and the offset of the spending tx.\n\nAs in txindex, entries of disconnected blocks are kept, so CustomRemove\ngoes away and FindSpender only returns spends in the active chain.\n\nFall back to the legacy entries if no spend is found.",
