      "message": "test: cover txospenderindex hash collisions, reorgs and legacy entries\n\nPin the encodings of the new and legacy keys, and add unit tests for\nhash prefix false positives, for entries of disconnected blocks being\nkept but not returned, and for the fallback to legacy entries. Add a\nfunctional test that upgrades a v31 datadir, reorgs a block indexed in\nthe legacy format and downgrades again.",
